WEBVTT

00:06:56.347 --> 00:07:00.684
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:07:03.901 --> 00:07:06.831
Can you show us how excited you are?

00:07:06.831 --> 00:07:10.747
(Laughter)

00:07:11.113 --> 00:07:12.764
All right, big finish.

00:07:12.764 --> 00:07:16.436
Can you show us how good of a pilot you are?

00:07:17.818 --> 00:07:22.445
(Applause)

00:07:22.468 --> 00:07:24.954
All right, we still have a little ways to go with that,

00:07:24.954 --> 00:07:27.466
but I think it shows the promise.

00:07:27.466 --> 00:07:30.102
What makes Henry's story amazing